---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Services" description="GreaterThan works across three connected layers of independent consulting — Strategy & Advisory, Execution Support, and Coaching & Leadership.">

<!-- HERO -->
<section class="hero hero--sub section--indigo">
  <div class="container">
    <span class="eyebrow eyebrow--light reveal">How we work</span>
    <h1>The three layers of independent consulting.</h1>
    <p class="lead">The work runs in three connected layers. Each addresses a different need; together they form a complete marketing function on demand. Pick the layer that fits your situation right now, or combine them as your business grows.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- SERVICE CARDS -->
<section class="section section--paper">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="services-cards">

      <div class="service-card-item reveal">
        <span class="eyebrow">Layer 1</span>
        <h2>Strategy &amp; Advisory</h2>
        <p>The leadership work. Direct guidance on marketing strategy, from the principal who runs it. Scoping, strategy assessment, capability evaluation, governance, planning oversight. Run at whatever cadence makes sense: quarterly check-ins or weekly involvement.</p>
        <p class="best-for"><strong>Best for:</strong> Businesses needing clarity on direction, strategy validation, or a senior external eye on the marketing that's already running.</p>
        <a href="/services/strategy-advisory" class="btn btn--ghost">Learn more <span class="arrow">→</span></a>
      </div>

      <div class="service-card-item reveal d1">
        <span class="eyebrow">Layer 2</span>
        <h2>Execution Support</h2>
        <p>The delivery work. When your strategy calls for a campaign, a rebrand, a new website, or AI enablement, GreaterThan scopes the brief, sources the right resource, and oversees it through to completion.</p>
        <p class="best-for"><strong>Best for:</strong> Businesses with clear strategy who need help executing it, sourcing specialists, or overseeing the work without running it directly.</p>
        <a href="/services/execution-support" class="btn btn--ghost">Learn more <span class="arrow">→</span></a>
      </div>

      <div class="service-card-item reveal d2">
        <span class="eyebrow">Layer 3</span>
        <h2>Coaching &amp; Leadership</h2>
        <p>The development work. Where you have marketing talent inside the business who need to step up to meet the demands of growth, GreaterThan coaches them directly.</p>
        <p class="best-for"><strong>Best for:</strong> Businesses investing in their people, where internal marketing talent needs to level up faster than experience alone will get them there.</p>
        <a href="/services/coaching-leadership" class="btn btn--ghost">Learn more <span class="arrow">→</span></a>
      </div>

    </div>

    <div class="services-bottom-cta reveal">
      <p>Not sure which layer is right?</p>
      <a href="/contact" class="btn btn--primary">Book a discovery call <span class="arrow">→</span></a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- CTA BAND -->
<section class="cta-band">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="cta-band__inner">
      <h2>Ready to get started?</h2>
      <div class="cta-band__right">
        <span class="cta-band__email">hello@wearegreaterthan.co.nz</span>
        <a href="/contact" class="btn btn--primary-dark">Start a project <span class="arrow">→</span></a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

</BaseLayout>
